# Dependencies are installed inside the image; copying a host node_modules
# would bring native binaries built for the wrong platform.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build

# Secrets and local config. .env is gitignored and must never enter the image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Not needed to run the app.
**/tests
**/scripts
**/*.test.ts
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.github
**/docs
**/README.md
**/.DS_Store
**/temp
**/backups
.vscode
.idea